power: supply: sc27xx: force retained-register strobes and snapshot live SOC before reset

Dashboard reads are optional; reboot must preserve the latest coulomb count.
Retained SET/CLEAR registers require unconditional writes even when their
readback is unchanged. Limit shutdown sampling to populated UMP9620 batteries.

--- a/drivers/power/supply/sc27xx_fuel_gauge.c
